Z||000005||stingant0||12-10-2001||07:10 PM||||Remeber to not over boost. The internals can't handle much boost, I think that 6-7 psi is about the highest you can go, also remember to lower your compresion to about 7:5:1. If you find a DOHC 3.4 buy it and use the internals, they are forged. There are alot of guys that are running turbos on here so they will help you out.||||reg||1
